Yantho was a [[Bestiary/Spark of Humanity#Human|Human]] with bright blue eyes, heavy scarring across the left half of his face, and a large, teal tattoo of a dragon across his arms and upper torso.

Yantho was a mid-ranking member of [[Org/Althane/Red Dragon Rail Company|RDRco]], responsible for the northern expansion of the rail by Fort Sera. He was assassinated on a train headed south after securing the expansion by [[People/Althane/Burr|Burr]], a mind-controlled member of the [[Org/Althane/Ghost Coal Chain Gang|Ghost Coal Chain Gang]].
